From: RICE0707 <master.end.9377@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:20:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Optimize getScaledTrackingDistance

Original license: GPL-3.0-only
Original project: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf

Skip the multiplication and division when the entity broadcast range is 100 percent.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java b/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java
index e3830365ec49c77a325a78edba4cb34899a9dbe5..e9bc1be75bffd4db14c0bd9b6af4b0daadbf9c33 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java
@@ -955,7 +955,10 @@ public class DedicatedServer extends MinecraftServer implements ServerInterface
 
     @Override
     public int getScaledTrackingDistance(final int range) {
-        return this.entityBroadcastRangePercentage() * range / 100;
+        // Misteln start - optimize getScaledTrackingDistance
+        final int percentage = this.entityBroadcastRangePercentage();
+        return percentage == 100 ? range : percentage * range / 100;
+        // Misteln end - optimize getScaledTrackingDistance
     }
 
     public int entityBroadcastRangePercentage() {
